label Initialization
units metal
dimension 3
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
newton on
label System_Construction
region whole block 0 66 0 66 0 213 units box
create_box 1 whole
lattice bcc 3.3
region target block 0 66 0 66 0 132 units box
region projectile block 0 66 0 66 147 213 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
group target region target
group projectile region projectile
label Potential
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
label Miscellaneous
timestep 0.005
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press lx ly lz
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
label Production_Run
fix eq all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 20000
unfix eq
reset_timestep 0
velocity projectile add 0 0 -20 sum yes
fix prod all nve
run 40000
